ry destination</li></ul></article><article class=\"bx-panel dark\"><h3>Turn the idea into a reviewable brief</h3><p>Start with a model reference. Then align artwork, sample approval and packing with the project’s deadline.</p><ul><li>Identify artwork versions and approval owner</li><li>Review the sample against actual use</li><li>Separate personal gifts from shared service items</li></ul></article></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">A FOCUSED STARTING SELECTION</p><h2>Model references to compare.</h2></div><p>These are selection suggestions, not completed customer projects. Check the specific model before ordering.</p></div><div class=\"bx-model-grid\"><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"BSB-005\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/22-oz-tournament-mood-stadium-cup/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/bsb-005-b1771b5779.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware 22 oz. Tournament Mood Stadium Cup\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">BSB-005</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/22-oz-tournament-mood-stadium-cup/\">22 oz. Tournament Mood Stadium Cup</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">plastic · 22 oz</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/22-oz-tournament-mood-stadium-cup/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"BSB-010\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/17-oz-sun-altering-stadium-cup/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/bsb-010-ddafda1504.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware 17 oz. Sun Altering Stadium Cup-Full Color\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">BSB-010</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/17-oz-sun-altering-stadium-cup/\">17 oz. Sun Altering Stadium Cup-Full Color</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">plastic · 17 oz</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/17-oz-sun-altering-stadium-cup/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"SJB-006\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/full-color-stadium-cup-sjb006/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/sjb-006-c29550e9b5.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Full Color Stadium Cup - 17 oz.\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">SJB-006</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/full-color-stadium-cup-sjb006/\">Full Color Stadium Cup - 17 oz.</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">PP · 17 oz</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/full-color-stadium-cup-sjb006/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"PJB-013\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/beverage-beer-bat-cup/\"><img src=\"/img/repairs-20261101/pjb-013-4d635ff9ce9a.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Long-Tube Beer Bat Cup\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">PJB-013</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/beverage-beer-bat-cup/\">Beverage Beer Bat Cup</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">PP</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/beverage-beer-bat-cup/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"PJB-015\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/beverage-beer-bat-cup-with-stand/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/pjb-015-dd16b7b3