6oz-flight-taster/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"BPJJ-005\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/silicone-25oz-handled-barrel-bpjj005/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/bpjj-005-7fcdec5ac7.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"BOOM Drinkware Silicone 25 oz Handled Barrel\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">Model / artwork reference · approve final configuration</p><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">BPJJ-005</p><h3><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/products/silicone-25oz-handled-barrel-bpjj005/\">Silicone 25 oz Handled Barrel</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">silicone · 25 oz</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/silicone-25oz-handled-barrel-bpjj005/\">View Details & Customization</a></div></article></div><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/products/\">Explore the Full Product Catalog →</a></div></section><section class=\"bx-section bx-tinted\"><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>From requirements to an approved order.</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-step-grid\"><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>01</span><h3>Define the brief</h3><p>Share use, quantity, artwork and destination.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>02</span><h3>Agree the proposal</h3><p>Review model, configuration, cost and schedule.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>03</span><h3>Approve the sample</h3><p>Identify the approved artwork and sample version.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>04</span><h3>Produce & deliver</h3><p>Agree inspection, packing and delivery requirements.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-qa\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">BUYER QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clear answers before the next step.</h2></div></div><details><summary>Can I enquire before choosing a model?</summary><p>Yes. Describe the intended use, quantity and arrival date; add a reference or drawing if available.</p></details><details><summary>What determines MOQ and lead time?</summary><p>The model, materials, design versions, decoration, packaging and tooling affect the proposal. Small batches from 10 pieces and fast sampling apply to eligible projects; confirm the conditions in your quote.</p></details><details><summary>What should my enquiry include?</summary><p>A model or product idea, quantity, artwork, pack contents, destination and required arrival date are a useful start.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><section class=\"bx-brief-strip\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Let’s make your project specific.</h2><p>Share the model or idea, quantity, artwork, destination and arrival date. You can add files in the project enquiry.</p></div><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/contact/?models=Custom%20Sports%20Team%20Drinkware\">Request a Project Quote ↗</a></section></div></div>"},"/zh/sports-team-cups/":{"title":"运动球队杯具定制 | BOOM Drinkware","description":"为球队、俱乐部或体育活动规划品牌杯具与周边系列。","html":"<div class=\"bx-site\"><section class=\"bx-business-hero\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-business-grid\"><div><nav class=\"bx-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> / 运动球队杯具定制</nav><p class=\"bx-kicker\">应用场景 / 采购规划</p><h1>运动球队杯具定制</h1><p class=\"bx-lead\">为球队、俱乐部或体育活动规划品牌杯具与周边系列。</p><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Custom%20Sports%20Team%20Drinkware\">提交项目询价 ↗</a><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/zh/products/\">浏览产品型号</a></div></div><figure class=\"bx-business-photo\"><img src=\"/occ-tailgate.webp\" alt=\"运动球队杯具定制 — 视觉参考\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>规划概念图 · 非实际客户订单或工厂实拍。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-section-headi